---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Return & Refund Policy - FableTech Group" description="FableTech Group return and refund policy. Understand our warranty, return procedures, and customer satisfaction guarantee." locale="en">
  <div class="bg-gray-50 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Return & Refund Policy</h1>
      
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">1. Warranty Coverage</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          All FableTech Group products come with a comprehensive warranty covering manufacturing 
          defects and material quality issues:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 mb-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Standard Products:</strong> 12-month warranty from delivery date</li>
          <li><strong>Custom Products:</strong> 6-month warranty with specific terms</li>
          <li><strong>Electronic Components:</strong> 24-month manufacturer warranty</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">2. Return Conditions</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          Products may be returned under the following conditions:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 mb-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Manufacturing defects or quality issues confirmed by our QC team</li>
          <li>Incorrect product shipped (different from order specifications)</li>
          <li>Products damaged during transit (with documented evidence)</li>
          <li>Products not matching the agreed specifications</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">3. Return Process</h2>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg mb-6">
          <ol class="list-decimal list-inside text-gray-600 space-y-3">
            <li><strong>Request Return:</strong> Contact us within 7 days of receiving the shipment</li>
            <li><strong>Provide Documentation:</strong> Submit photos, videos, and detailed description of the issue</li>
            <li><strong>Return Authorization:</strong> Receive RA number and shipping instructions</li>
            <li><strong>Ship Product Back:</strong> Send the product in original packaging</li>
            <li><strong>Quality Inspection:</strong> Our QC team will inspect within 5 business days</li>
            <li><strong>Resolution:</strong> Replacement, repair, or refund processed accordingly</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">4. Refund Timeline</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          Once we receive and inspect your returned item, refunds will be processed within 7-14 
          business days. The refund will be credited to your original payment method or account 
          as per your preference.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">5. Non-Returnable Items</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          The following items cannot be returned:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 mb-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Custom-made or bespoke products per your specifications</li>
          <li>Products that have been used, modified, or damaged by the buyer</li>
          <li>Products without original packaging or accessories</li>
          <li>Items marked as "Final Sale" or "Non-Returnable"</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">6. Quality Guarantee</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          FableTech Group is committed to quality assurance. Every shipment undergoes rigorous 
          inspection before dispatch. We maintain ISO 9001:2015 quality management system 
          certification and welcome third-party inspections.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-4 mt-8">
          <p class="text-blue-800">
            <strong>Need to report an issue?</strong> Contact our customer service team at 
            <a href="mailto:support@fabletech.com" class="underline">support@fabletech.com</a> 
            or through our <a href="/contact" class="underline">online form</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
